::Q001::[markdown]nom. pl. of the noun “human being”:{
	~%100%ἄνθρωποι#Correct: **ἄνθρωποι** is the correct form for nom. pl. of the noun “human being” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%δῶρα#Incorrect. **δῶρα** is the acc. pl. of the noun “gift” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%ἀγορᾷ#Incorrect. **ἀγορᾷ** is the dat. sing. of the noun “marketplace” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%νήσοις#Incorrect. **νήσοις** is the dat. pl. of the noun “island” (Ch. 1).
	~%-100%λόγῳ#Incorrect. **λόγῳ** is the dat. sing. of the noun “word” (Ch. 1).
}


