	~%-100%aorist (1) active optative 1st sing. of the verb “I loosen”#Incorrect. The aorist (1) active optative 1st sing. of the verb “I loosen” is **-** (Ch. 3).
	~%100%future active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I loosen”#Correct: **λύσετε** is future active indicative 2nd pl. of the verb “I loosen” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%imperfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I send”#Incorrect. The imperfect active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I send” is **ἐπέμπομεν** (Ch. 3).
